{"id":"7bf22713c4373b48e0eb1b51f89347d545c4aeb2","url":"https://www.leiphone.com/category/industrynews/oxR5pn9S7tI1IfF5.html","title":"腾讯的 Agent 布局，不止 WorkBuddy | 雷峰网","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":null,"excerpt":"大家对腾讯Agent的认识，还不够完整。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n                                                <!-- 123 -->\n                        \n                        \n                                                \n                        <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- xhBPeYDbNuuRZkwy -->\n                                                <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- 正文内容 -->\n                        <section data-mpa-action-id=\"mmiwq6ij1i3r\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img alt=\"腾讯的 Agent 布局，不止 WorkBuddy\" data-src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261108/6af07444f2e62.png\" data-ratio=\"0.584375\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/XqAicMdcoiafPyD8DNeRvKop3pBibUFoFWXic19lybHQQ8uESpWs4f9AeN08JaBunehcxXib168HKCBdNMvQv0IurLzrV0r3IBNonB65S0SP3Bqg/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"546\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"300\" data-imgfileid=\"100264879\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261108/6af07444f2e62.png?imageMogr2/quality/90\"></section><section data-pm-slice=\"5 10 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix4tgk1t7p\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-data-temp-type=\"image\" mpa-data-temp-power-by=\"yiban.io\" data-mpa-template=\"t\" data-mid=\"\"><section><section><span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix6wyl1l05\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\">&#160;大家对腾讯Agent的认识，还不够完整。</span></span></span></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mpmlbwxl8oz\"></span><span data-lark-record-data=\"{&quot;rootId&quot;:&quot;FdZeduLh9ohPKcxr1VDcCN8nnRh&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;initialAttributedTexts&quot;:{&quot;text